# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Lesson notes are NOT tracked, on purpose.
#
# This repo is public. The lesson prose on shipthatcode.com is their
# copyrighted material -- pasting it here and pushing would republish it.
# notes/ lives outside courses/ so it can never be swept into a public
# per-course mirror by `stc publish` either.
#
# Your own solutions and your own summaries belong in courses/<slug>/ and ARE
# tracked -- the grader needs them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
notes/*
!notes/.gitkeep
!notes/README.md

# Original starter downloads, kept only so `stc sync` can diff a new zip
# against the one you unpacked. Large and re-downloadable.
.zips/*
!.zips/.gitkeep

# Build artifacts from run_tests.sh (it compiles to .prog next to the source)
.prog
.prog.o
.prog.exe
.prog.jar
*.class

# Per-language local caches, if you bind-mount them
.cache/
target/
node_modules/
__pycache__/

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/settings.json
